      "afterExample": null,
      "text": "`hover-3d` works by placing 8 hover zones on top of the content. Each zone detects mouse movement and applies a slight rotation to the content based on the mouse position within that zone. The combined effect of all 8 zones creates a smooth and responsive 3D tilt effect as the user moves their mouse over the component.\n\nOnly use non-interactive content inside the `hover-3d` wrapper. If you want to make the entire card clickable, use a link for the whole `hover-3d` component instead of putting interactive elements like buttons or links inside it."
    }
